### 1. POST /books — sin título ni autor: 400 con details
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": ""
}

### 2. POST /books — stock negativo: 400, details sobre stock
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "X",
  "author": "Y",
  "stock": -3
}

### 3. POST /books — stock del tipo equivocado: 400
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "X",
  "author": "Y",
  "stock": "cinco"
}

### 4. POST /books — válido sin stock: 201 y stock = 0 (default de Zod)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ficciones",
  "author": "Jorge Luis Borges"
}

### 5. POST /books — ISBN mal formado: 400
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "El Aleph",
  "author": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "123"
}

### 6. POST /books — ISBN duplicado: 409 (lógica de negocio, no validación)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Duplicado",
  "author": "Test",
  "isbn": "9780393312838"
}

### 7. GET /books/999 — 404 armado por el errorHandler
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999

### 8. PUT /books/1 — update parcial: solo stock (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 5
}

### 9. GET /books — listar
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### 10. GET /books?page=1&limit=2 — paginado
GET http://localhost:3000/books?page=1&limit=2

### 11. GET /cualquier-cosa — notFound → errorHandler (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/cualquier-cosa
